  currentType: 0
  languages:
  - type: 0
    content: "Ch\xE0o b\u1EA1n. T\xF4i l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u d\u01B0\u1EE1ng Nguy\u1EC5n
      V\u0103n A. R\u1EA5t vui \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1EB7p b\u1EA1n. H\xF4m nay,
      t\xF4i s\u1EBD ti\u1EBFn h\xE0nh thay b\u0103ng, r\u1EEDa v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      cho b\u1EA1n. B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng ch\u01B0a?"
  - type: 1
    content: Hello. I am nurse Nguyen Van A. Nice to meet you. Today, I will change
      your bandage and clean your wound. Are you ready?
