      value: "\"D\xF9ng g\u1EA1c c\u1EE7 \u1EA5u th\u1EA5m dung d\u1ECBch NaCl 0,9%.\nR\u1EEDa
        t\u1EEB m\xE9p v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng ra b\xEAn ngo\xE0i da l\xE0nh r\u1ED3i
        b\u1ECF \u0111i.\nR\u1EEDa t\u1EEB ch\xEDnh gi\u1EEFa v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng
        ra m\xE9p v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng r\u1ED3i b\u1ECF \u0111i.\nL\u01B0u \xFD:
        R\u1EEDa b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch th\u1EA5m nh\u1EB9, kh\xF4ng c\u1ECD x\xE1t m\u1EA1nh.\"\t\t\t"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
